sections.example:
Input: one row, id=A, status=open, minutes=0
Expected: {"count": 1, "total_minutes": 0}
Legacy: {"count": 0, "total_minutes": 0}
The count assertion distinguishes the implementations.

python report.py tickets.csv
stdout: {"count": 4, "total_minutes": 20}
python report.py tickets.csv --status open
stdout: {"count": 2, "total_minutes": 12}
python report.py tickets.csv --status missing
stderr: argument error; exit 2
